ominion reinforcements arrive.\n\nMap: Players deploy along the bottom Alliance edge. The minefield deployment zone is the upper band C. Randomly place six asteroids in the marked central region, at least Range 1 apart. All other edges are Dominion. Initial forces use bearings 3 and 4. See p. 8 for exact region boundaries.\n\nObjective: Deploy the complete mine supply, then retreat; at least one player must escape to win. Advance to Sleeping Targs after either outcome.\n\nXP and deadline: All mines deployed grants each player 2 XP. Destroyed players receive 1 fewer, minimum 0. Retreat through the bottom Alliance edge. End Round 12 automatically retreats remaining players.\n\n Formation  Round  Bearing  Orders  2p  3p  4p  5p  6p \n---------------------------\n Dominion 1st Wing  Setup  3  Hunt  AS-D  AS-D  -  AS-D  - \n Cardassian Gul  Setup  4  Attack  G-E  -  G-E  -  G-E \n Dominion 2nd Wing  3  Roll  Hunt  AS  AS  -  AS  - \n Dominion 3rd Wing (HARD ONLY)  3  Roll  Hunt  AS  -  AS  -  AS \n Cardassian Glinn  5  Roll  Attack  -  G  -  -  G \n Dominion Alpha  7  Roll  Attack  AS-E  -  AS-E  -  AS-E \n\nMine supply: 2/3/4/5/6 players use 5/7/10/12/15 mission tokens. Ignore printed numbers. Before deployment, distribute every mine among player ship cards; distribution may be unequal and individual capacity is unlimited.\n\nDeploy Mine action: A loaded player ship ending its maneuver fully inside C may use its action to move one carried mine beside its model. It cannot do so if another ship within Range 1 has a mission token beside it. End Phase: move all placed mines to the top edge, representing completed deployment.\n\nHunt: Maneuvers target the closest player carrying at least one mine. Attacks target the closest player with a mission token beside it, except that when this target is beyond Range 1, another legal Range 1 target can be attacked. The book does not expressly state the fallback when no loaded carrier remains.\n\n","manualRules":["Resolve special movement, target orders, objectives, XP, penalties and retreat manually. See the Rules card."]},"A5M1":{"id":"A5M1","name":"Alliance Act V - Sleeping Targs","book2":true,"act":5,"maxRound":12,"sourcePages":[10,11],"profiles":{"ASR":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":1,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"285600","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 1 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"ASE":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":4,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"325000","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 4 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"GR":{"className":"Cardassian Galor Class","definitionId":"S334","skill":2,"shields":3,"hull":4,"cardId":"288300","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 2 | Hull 4 | Shields 3. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"GE":{"className":"Cardassian Galor Class","definitionId":"S334","skill":5,"shields":3,"hull":4,"cardId":"288300","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 5 | Hull 4 | Shields 3. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"BCR":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Battle Cruiser","definitionId":"S381","skill":5,"shields":4,"hull":6,"cardId":"288900","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 5 | Hull 6 | Shields 4. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"BCE":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Battle Cruiser","definitionId":"S381","skill":7,"shields":4,"hull":6,"cardId":"288900","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 7 | Hull 6 | Shields 4. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"generic":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":1,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"285600","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 1 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"advanced":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":4,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"325000","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 4 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."}},"geometry":{"kind":"shipyards","asteroidCount":0,"planet":{"u":0.0,"v":0.0,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":2},"allianceEdges":["bottom"],"playerAreas":[{"kind":"corner","u":1,"v":-1}],"bearings":[{"u":-0.3333333333333333,"v":-1.0,"edge":"bottom","rotation":180},{"u":-1.0,"v":-0.3333333333333333,"edge":"left","rotation":270},{"u":-1.0,"v":0.3333333333333333,"edge":"left","rotation":270},{"u":-0.3333333333333333,"v":1.0,"edge":"top","rotation":0},{"u":0.3333333333333333,"v":1.0,"edge":"top","rotation":0},{"u":1.0,"v":0.3333333333333333,"edge":"right","rotation":90}],"yards":[{"u":-0.6666666666666666,"v":-0.6666666666666666,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":2,"docks":[{"u":-0.7555555555555555,"v":-0.5777777777777778,"rotation":225,"minPlayers":2},{"u":-0.5777777777777778,"v":-0.7555555555555555,"rotation":225,"minPlayers":2}]},{"u":0.0,"v":0.6666666666666666,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":2,"docks":[{"u":-0.13333333333333333,"v":0.6666666666666666,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":2}]},{"u":0.6666666666666666,"v":0.0,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":3,"docks":[{"u":0.6666666666666666,"v":0.13333333333333333,"rotation":90,"minPlayers":3},{"u":0.6666666666666666,"v":-0.13333333333333333,"rotation":90,"minPlayers":3}]},{"u":-0.6666666666666666,"v":0.0,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":4,"docks":[{"u":-0.6666666666666666,"v":0.13333333333333333,"rotation":270,"minPlayers":4}]},{"u":0.0,"v":-0.6666666666666666,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":5,"docks":[{"u":-0.13333333333333333,"v":-0.6666666666666666,"rotation":180,"minPlayers":5}]},{"u":0.6666666666666666,"v":0.6666666666666666,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":6,"docks":[{"u":0.5777777777777778,"v":0.7555555555555555,"rotation":45,"minPlayers":6},{"u":0.7555555555555555,"v":0.5777777777777778,"rotation":45,"minPlayers":6}]}]},"objective":{"kind":"shipyards","manual":true},"formations":[{"id":"wave1","name":"Cardassian Glinn","round":0,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"4":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave2","name":"Dominion Alpha","round":2,"orders":"Alert","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"always","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave3","name":"Cardassian Gul","round":5,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"always","quantity":1}],"5":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"always","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave4","name":"Dominion Beta (HARD ONLY)","round":6,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":true,"columns":{"3":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}]}}],"rulesText":"Sleeping Targs\n\nMap and mission parameters, p. 10\n\nBriefing: Strike the shipyards at Torros III while their attack ships are still powered down.\n\nMap: Players deploy in the lower-right corner. Central planet. Shipyards and docked AS use the printed sites and facings: the base lower-left yard has two AS and the base upper-middle yard has one AS; add a right-side yard with two at 3p, left-side yard with one at 4p, lower-center yard with one at 5p, and upper-right yard with two at 6p. Thus 2/3/4/5/6p have 2/3/4/5/6 yards and 3/5/6/7/9 docked AS. Bottom is the Alliance edge; the other three edges are Dominion.\n\nObjective: Destroy every shipyard and retreat. A remaining yard at end Round 12 means failure. Failure adds 1 Influence; either outcome advances to A Time to Stand.\n\nXP and deadline: 1 XP each for all yards destroyed; +1 for all BC destroyed; +1 for all AS destroyed. Destroyed players receive 1 fewer XP, printed minimum 1. Retreat through the bottom edge by end Round 12; all remaining players are destroyed then.\n\n Formation  Round  Bearing  Orders  2p  3p  4p  5p  6p \n---------------------------\n Cardassian Glinn  Setup  Roll  Attack  G-D  -  G-D  -  G-D \n Dominion Alpha  2  Roll  Alert  BC-E  -  -  -  - \n Cardassian Gul  5  Roll  Attack  G-E  -  -  G-E  - \n Dominion Beta (HARD ONLY)  6  Roll  Attack  -  BC-D  -  -  BC-D \n\nDocked ships: Number every powered-down AS sequentially from 1. They neither activate nor attack, have Agility 0 and no active shields. When powered up, restore normal agility and the standard shield complement; they then activate/attack at their usual Skill. The book does not explicitly specify a regular/Elite distinction for these docked AS.\n\nPower-up pool: Use cumulative token entries: 2p = 1,2,3,10; add 4,5 at 3p; add 6,11 at 4p; add 7,8 at 5p; add 9,12 at 6p. Shuffle facedown. At each round's start, before Planning, reveal 1/2/2/3/3 tokens for 2/3/4/5/6p and remove them from the pool. Matching numbered AS power up; unmatched numbers do nothing. Any AS within Range 1 of a BC also powers up automatically.\n\nAlert BC: Maneuvers toward the closest powered-down AS; changes to Attack if none remain. In Combat, attacks the closest player normally.\n\nShipyards: Based ship targets; no attack, Agility 0, Hull 5, Shields 0. Can be target locked. Each uncancelled critical is two hits. Destroying a yard deals one critical damage to every AS still docked there; those ships remain powered down. During Combat, a player within Range 1-3 of at least one yard rolls one fewer defense die (the wording does not stack per yard).\n\n","manualRules":["Resolve special movement, target orders, objectives, XP, penalties and retreat manually. See the Rules card."]},"A5M2":{"id":"A5M2","name":"Alliance Act V - A Time to Stand","book2":true,"act":5,"maxRound":12,"sourcePages":[12,13],"profiles":{"ASR":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":1,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"285600","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 1 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"ASE":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":4,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"325000","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 4 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"GR":{"className":"Cardassian Galor Class","definitionId":"S334","skill":2,"shields":3,"hull":4,"cardId":"288300","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 2 | Hull 4 | Shields 3. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"GE":{"className":"Cardassian Galor Class","definitionId":"S334","skill":5,"shields":3,"hull":4,"cardId":"288300","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 5 | Hull 4 | Shields 3. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"BCR":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Battle Cruiser","definitionId":"S381","skill":5,"shields":4,"hull":6,"cardId":"288900","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 5 | Hull 6 | Shields 4. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"BCE":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Battle Cruiser","definitionId":"S381","skill":7,"shields":4,"hull":6,"cardId":"288900","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 7 | Hull 6 | Shields 4. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"generic":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":1,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"285600","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 1 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"advanced":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":4,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"325000","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 4 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."}},"geometry":{"kind":"pulsarBattle","asteroidCount":3,"pulsarCount":3,"obstacleZone":{"uMin":-0.7777777777777778,"uMax":0.7777777777777778,"vMin":-0.7777777777777778,"vMax":0.7777777777777778},"planet":{"u":-0.2222222222222222,"v":0.2222222222222222,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":2},"allianceEdges":["bottom"],"playerAreas":[{"kind":"strip","v":-0.7777777777777778}],"bearings":[{"u":-1.0,"v":0.4444444444444444,"edge":"left","rotation":270},{"u":-0.7777777777777778,"v":1.0,"edge":"top","rotation":0},{"u":-0.3333333333333333,"v":1.0,"edge":"top","rotation":0},{"u":0.3333333333333333,"v":1.0,"edge":"top","rotation":0},{"u":0.7777777777777778,"v":1.0,"edge":"top","rotation":0},{"u":1.0,"v":0.4444444444444444,"edge":"right","rotation":90}]},"objective":{"kind":"pulsarBattle","manual":true},"formations":[{"id":"wave1","name":"Dominion 1st Wing","round":0,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"4":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}]},"bearing":3},{"id":"wave2","name":"Dominion 2nd Wing","round":0,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"3":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"5":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}]},"bearing":4},{"id":"wave3","name":"Dominion Alpha","round":2,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"always","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave4","name":"Cardassian Gul","round":4,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"always","quantity":1}],"4":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"always","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"always","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave5","name":"Dominion 3rd Wing","round":6,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"3":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"4":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"always","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave6","name":"Dominion 4th Wing (HARD ONLY)","round":6,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":true,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"3":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"5":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave7","name":"Cardassian Glinn","round":8,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"3":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"5":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"regular","quantity":1}]}}],"rulesText":"A Time to Stand\n\nMap and mission parameters, p. 12\n\nBriefing: Hold the Tyra system long enough to damage the Dominion advance, then withdraw.\n\nMap: Players deploy in the bottom strip; planet above/left of center. Randomly place three asteroids and three pulsars inside the marked interior, at least Range 1 from any other obstacle or the planet. Bottom is Alliance; the other edges are Dominion. Initial wings enter at bearings 3 and 4.\n\nObjective: Destroy at least one enemy ship per player, and have at least one player survive and retreat on Round 10, 11, or 12. Failure adds 1 Influence. Advance to Behind the Lines after either outcome.\n\nXP and deadline: 1 XP each at one enemy destroyed per player; +1 at two per player. Destroyed players receive 1 fewer, printed minimum 1. Retreat permitted on Rounds 10-12 through the bottom Alliance edge. End Round 12 destroys remaining players.\n\n Formation  Round  Bearing  Orders  2p  3p  4p  5p  6p \n---------------------------\n Dominion 1st Wing  Setup  3  Attack  AS  -  AS  -  AS \n Dominion 2nd Wing  Setup  4  Attack  AS  AS  -  AS  - \n Dominion Alpha  2  Roll  Attack  BC-E  -  -  -  - \n Cardassian Gul  4  Roll  Attack  G-E  -  G-E  -  G-E \n Dominion 3rd Wing  6  Roll  Attack  AS-D  AS-D  BC-E  -  AS-D \n Dominion 4th Wing (HARD ONLY)  6  Roll  Attack  AS-D  AS-D  -  AS-D  BC-D \n Cardassian Glinn  8  Roll  Attack  G  G  -  G  - \n\nPulsars: Treated as asteroid-like obstacles, including overlap and damage rolls; enemy AI swerves to avoid them when possible. A ship within Range 1 of a pulsar cannot attack beyond Range 1 and cannot be attacked by ships beyond Range 1. This affects enemy action selection. When choosing an attack target, spend a Scan Token to ignore all pulsar effects until round end; this expenditure does not also grant Scan's normal effect. Enemy AI always spends it when this enables an attack.\n\n","manualRules":["Resolve special movement, target orders, objectives, XP, penalties and retreat manually. See the Rules card."]},"A5M3":{"id":"A5M3","name":"Alliance Act V - Behind the Lines","book