inted bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"generic":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":1,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"285600","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 1 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"advanced":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":4,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"325000","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 4 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."}},"geometry":{"kind":"sensorRaid","asteroidCount":0,"pulsarCount":4,"separationRanges":2,"obstacleZone":{"uMin":-0.7777777777777778,"uMax":0.7777777777777778,"vMin":-0.7777777777777778,"vMax":0.7777777777777778},"sensorArray":{"u":-0.7222222222222222,"v":0.7222222222222222,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":2},"allianceEdges":["bottom","right"],"playerAreas":[{"kind":"corner","u":1,"v":-1}],"bearings":[{"u":-1.0,"v":-0.8888888888888888,"edge":"left","rotation":270},{"u":-1.0,"v":-0.2222222222222222,"edge":"left","rotation":270},{"u":-1.0,"v":0.4444444444444444,"edge":"left","rotation":270},{"u":-0.4444444444444444,"v":1.0,"edge":"top","rotation":0},{"u":0.2222222222222222,"v":1.0,"edge":"top","rotation":0},{"u":0.8888888888888888,"v":1.0,"edge":"top","rotation":0}]},"objective":{"kind":"sensorRaid","manual":true},"formations":[{"id":"wave1","name":"Dominion 1st Division","round":0,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"4":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"regular","quantity":1}]},"sites":[{"u":-0.6666666666666666,"v":0.4444444444444444,"rotation":315,"minPlayers":2},{"u":-0.4444444444444444,"v":0.6666666666666666,"rotation":315,"minPlayers":4},{"u":-0.4444444444444444,"v":0.4444444444444444,"rotation":315,"minPlayers":6}]},{"id":"wave2","name":"Dominion 2nd Wing (round 2)","round":2,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"3":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"5":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave3","name":"Dominion 3rd Wing","round":3,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"4":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave4","name":"Dominion 2nd Wing (round 4, printed repeated name)","round":4,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"3":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"5":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave5","name":"Dominion Beta (HARD ONLY)","round":5,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":true,"columns":{"3":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave6","name":"Cardassian Glinn","round":7,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"4":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"regular","quantity":1}]}}],"rulesText":"Behind the Lines\n\nMap and mission parameters, p. 14\n\nBriefing: Navigate the Argolis Cluster and destroy the sensor array tracking Alliance movements.\n\nMap: Players deploy in the lower-right corner. Sensor array in the upper-left corner region B, and initial BC division at C with the printed facings. Randomly place four pulsars in the indicated area, at least Range 2 apart. Bottom/right are Alliance edges; top/left are Dominion.\n\nObjective: Destroy the sensor array, then have at least one player survive and retreat by end Round 12. Failure adds 1 Influence. Advance to Favor the Bold after either outcome unless the Influence loss threshold is reached.\n\nXP and deadline: 1 XP each for destroying the array; +1 if every BC in the initial 1st Division is destroyed. Destroyed players receive 1 fewer, printed minimum 1. Retreat through an Alliance edge by end Round 12; remaining players are destroyed then.\n\n Formation  Round  Bearing  Orders  2p  3p  4p  5p  6p \n---------------------------\n Dominion 1st Division  Setup  C  Attack  BC  -  BC  -  BC \n Dominion 2nd Wing (round 2)  2  Roll  Attack  AS-D  AS-D  -  AS-D  - \n Dominion 3rd Wing  3  Roll  Attack  AS-D  -  AS-D  -  AS-D \n Dominion 2nd Wing (round 4, printed repeated name)  4  Roll  Attack  AS  AS  -  AS  - \n Dominion Beta (HARD ONLY)  5  Roll  Attack  -  BC-D  -  -  BC-D \n Cardassian Glinn  7  Roll  Attack  G  -  G  -  G \n\nSensor array: Based ship target, can be target locked, no attack, Agility 0, Hull 4, two shields per player. Each uncancelled critical counts as two hits.\n\nPulsars: Apply all rules from A Time to Stand. Additionally, at start Combat: while the array is intact, give Scan Tokens to the two lowest-numbered enemy AI ships. Then roll one attack die per pulsar. On a critical result, every ship within Range 1 of that pulsar immediately receives a face-up damage card, even with active shields. Other results do nothing. Multiple nearby pulsars can each cause damage.\n\n","manualRules":["Resolve special movement, target orders, objectives, XP, penalties and retreat manually. See the Rules card."]},"A6M1":{"id":"A6M1","name":"Alliance Act VI - Favor the Bold","book2":true,"act":6,"maxRound":9,"sourcePages":[16,17],"profiles":{"ASR":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":1,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"285600","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 1 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"ASE":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":4,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"325000","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 4 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"GR":{"className":"Cardassian Galor Class","definitionId":"S334","skill":2,"shields":3,"hull":4,"cardId":"288300","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 2 | Hull 4 | Shields 3. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"GE":{"className":"Cardassian Galor Class","definitionId":"S334","skill":5,"shields":3,"hull":4,"cardId":"288300","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 5 | Hull 4 | Shields 3. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"BCR":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Battle Cruiser","definitionId":"S381","skill":5,"shields":4,"hull":6,"cardId":"288900","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 5 | Hull 6 | Shields 4. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"BCE":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Battle Cruiser","definitionId":"S381","skill":7,"shields":4,"hull":6,"cardId":"288900","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 7 | Hull 6 | Shields 4. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"generic":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":1,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"285600","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 1 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"advanced":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":4,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"325000","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 4 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."}},"geometry":{"kind":"breakthrough","asteroidCount":0,"escorts":true,"allianceEdges":["bottom","top"],"playerAreas":[{"kind":"strip","v":-0.7777777777777778}],"bearings":[{"u":-1.0,"v":0.2222222222222222,"edge":"left","rotation":270},{"u":-1.0,"v":0.6666666666666666,"edge":"left","rotation":270},{"u":-0.6666666666666666,"v":1.0,"edge":"top","rotation":0},{"u":0.6666666666666666,"v":1.0,"edge":"top","rotation":0},{"u":1.0,"v":0.6666666666666666,"edge":"right","rotation":90},{"u":1.0,"v":0.2222222222222222,"edge":"right","rotation":90}]},"objective":{"kind":"breakthrough","manual":true},"formations":[{"id":"wave1","name":"Cardassian Blockade","round":0,"orders":"Hold","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"always","quantity":2}],"3":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"always","quantity":1}],"4":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"always","quantity":1}],"5":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"always","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"G","elite":"always","quantity":1}]},"sites":[{"u":-0.4444444444444444,"v":0.6666666666666666,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":2},{"u":0.4444444444444444,"v":0.6666666666666666,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":2},{"u":0.0,"v":0.2222222222222222,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":3},{"u":0.0,"v":0.6666666666666666,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":4},{"u":-0.4444444444444444,"v":0.2222222222222222,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":5},{"u":0.4444444444444444,"v":0.2222222222222222,"rotation":0,"minPlayers":6}]},{"id":"wave2","name":"Dominion 1st Wing","round":0,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"always","quantity":1}],"3":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"5":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave3","name":"Dominion 2nd Wing (HARD ONLY)","round":0,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":true,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"4":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"5":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave4","name":"Dominion 3rd Wing","round":2,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"3":[{"ship_class":"BC","elite":"always","quantity":1}],"5":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"regular","quantity":1}]}},{"id":"wave5","name":"Dominion 4th Wing","round":4,"orders":"Attack","hardOnly":false,"columns":{"2":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"4":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}],"6":[{"ship_class":"AS","elite":"difficulty_only","quantity":1}]}}],"rulesText":"Favor the Bold\n\nMap and mission parameters, p. 16\n\nBriefing: Break the Cardassian line to reach Deep Space Nine before the minefield falls.\n\nMap: Players deploy along the bottom strip. Blockade is in the upper half, facing down: two base Galors in the top row; add lower-middle at 3p, top-middle at 4p, lower-left at 5p, lower-right at 6p. Thus 2/3/4/5/6p use 2/3/4/5/6 Galors. Top and bottom are Alliance edges; left/right are Dominion. See p. 16 for exact positions.\n\nObjective, in order: (1) Destroy every Cardassian ship in play to open the line. (2) At least one player must survive and escape through the top edge by end Round 9. No player retreat until objective 1 is complete. Then the retreat row permits Alliance-edge retreat, but winning specifically requires a top-edge escape. Failure loses the campaign; success proceeds to Invasion of Betazed.\n\nXP and deadline: Mission success grants 2 XP each. At least half of the escorts surviving grants another 1 XP each. Destroyed players receive 1 fewer, printed minimum 1. End Round 9 destroys remaining players.\n\n Formation  Round  Bearing  Orders  2p  3p  4p  5p  6p \n---------------------------\n Cardassian Blockade  Setup  B  Hold  2 G-E  G-E  G-E  G-E  G-E \n Dominion 1st Wing  Setup  Roll  Attack  BC-E  AS  -  AS  - \n Dominion 2nd Wing (HARD ONLY)  Setup  Roll  Attack  AS  -  AS  BC-D  AS \n Dominion 3rd Wing  2  Roll  Attack  AS  BC-E  -  AS  AS \n Dominion 4th Wing  4  Roll  Attack  AS-D  -  AS-D  -  AS-D \n\nEscorts: One per player: Miranda for Federation captains, B'Rel for Klingon captains. Based ships; no attack, Agility 2, Hull 5, no shields shown. Deploy adjacent on any side of the player's ship, facing the same direction.\n\nEscort movement/support: Temporarily remove the escort when laying a movement template. After the player's maneuver and action, replace it in any adjacent formation position without overlap (or as close as possible). The player may then perform another action if they have no Auxiliary Power Token.\n\nEscort protection: Enemies consider escorts as player targets for movement, actions, and attacks. When either member of a player/escort pair is targeted, its player may redirect the attack to the other member. Resolve escort defense normally, except uncancelled criticals count as two hits. Track escort hull separately.\n\nHold: Every blockade ship skips Choose Maneuver until a player ship is within Range 1-3 of any blockade ship. All blockade ships then change to Attack and activate normally. They are not a shared formation and choose targets independently.\n\n","manualRules":["Resolve special movement, target orders, objectives, XP, penalties and retreat manually. See the Rules card."]},"A6M2":{"id":"A6M2","name":"Alliance Act VI - Invasion of Betazed (Finale)","book2":true,"act":6,"maxRound":10,"sourcePages":[18,19],"profiles":{"ASR":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"