 against hull only. While revealed and intact, all Jem'Hadar convert one blank attack result to a hit.\n\nOBJECTIVE: Destroy the facility, then have at least one player retreat or survive through Round 10. End Round 10, remaining players automatically retreat. Record the outcome and advance either way. Success gives every Act IX Jem'Hadar one starting hull damage, including reinforcements; choose the appropriate prior-result selector there.\n\nXP: 1 each for destroying the facility; +1 each for destroying all Jem'Hadar Battle Cruisers. Destroyed players subtract 1, minimum 1. Resolve combat, outcome and scoring manually."},"A8M2":{"id":"A8M2","name":"Alliance Act VIII - Supply Run","book2":true,"book3":true,"act":8,"maxRound":12,"profiles":{"ASR":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":1,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"285600","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 1 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"ASE":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":4,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"325000","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 4 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"GR":{"className":"Cardassian Galor Class","definitionId":"S334","skill":2,"shields":3,"hull":4,"cardId":"288300","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 2 | Hull 4 | Shields 3. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"GE":{"className":"Cardassian Galor Class","definitionId":"S334","skill":5,"shields":3,"hull":4,"cardId":"288300","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 5 | Hull 4 | Shields 3. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow