rrier fails the mission.\n\nPATROL: Handle patrol manually. If a player is within Range 3, use Attack Orders. Otherwise roll a bearing for each Galor as its movement destination. Galors still target lock and attack when possible.\n\nOBJECTIVE: Deliver all supplies to the resistance and have at least one player retreat or survive through Round 12. Remaining players automatically retreat at end Round 12. Record success/failure and advance. Success makes Cardassians defect in Dogs of War at start Round 4 rather than 5 and adds 2 TOTAL finale population.\n\nXP: 1 each for supplying the resistance, +1 each for destroying all Breen ships. Destroyed players subtract 1, minimum 1. Contact, delivery, combat, outcome and scoring are manual."},"A9M1":{"id":"A9M1","name":"Alliance Act IX - The Dogs of War","book2":true,"book3":true,"act":9,"maxRound":9,"profiles":{"ASR":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":1,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"285600","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 1 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"ASE":{"className":"Jem'Hadar Attack Ship","definitionId":"S301","skill":4,"shields":2,"hull":3,"cardId":"325000","advanced":true,"description":"Book II Elite | Skill 4 | Hull 3 | Shields 2. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"GR":{"className":"Cardassian Galor Class","definitionId":"S334","skill":2,"shields":3,"hull":4,"cardId":"288300","advanced":false,"description":"Book II Regular | Skill 2 | Hull 4 | Shields 3. Resolve printed card abilities manually. Starting stats follow user settings; printed bonus shields do not change these starting counts."},"GE":{"className":"Cardassian Galor Class","definitionId":"S334","skill":5,"shields":3,"hull":4,"cardId":"288300","advanced":true,"descript